OL,3,GNEWSAWill #4m be enough to get rough
OL,4,Asleepers off the streets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Mayor Tracy Brabin has
OL,7,Fsaid that almost #4m will be used to
OL,8,Fhelp people sleeping rough across the
OL,9,Fcounty, with Leeds and Bradford's
OL,10,Fcouncils set to get the largest amount
OL,11,F- so how has that announcement been
OL,12,Freceived on the streets of both those
OL,13,Fcities?
OL,15,FBegging outside a convenience store on
OL,16,FSunbridge Road in Bradford, Mark Green,
OL,17,F55, says he has been "in and out" of
OL,18,Fprison since 2011 and has been living
OL,19,Frough in Bradford for just under a
OL,20,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
